|lead=yes}} is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Akira Konno. It was serialized in Shogakukan's  manga magazine Monthly Shōnen Sunday from September 2021 to April 2024, with its chapters collected in five  volumes. An anime television series adaptation produced by Studio Hibari premiered in April 2026.
Plot
In his first year of middle school, Arata Kōda encounters a strange creature named Kujima. The Kōda household is on edge due to the stress of their eldest son preparing for entrance exams, so when Kujima enters, it brings fresh air and begins to calm the tension.
