Reception
The series was nominated for the 2022 Next Manga Award in the print manga category and placed 18th out of 50 nominees. Alongside Fool Night and Nippon Sangoku, Kujima: Why Sing, When You Can Warble? ranked twelfth in the 2023 edition of Takarajimasha's Kono Manga ga Sugoi! list of best manga for male readers. The manga ranked ninth in the "Nationwide Bookstore Employees' Recommended Comics of 2023" survey answered by bookstore clerks in Japan; it was ranked twelfth in the 2024 survey. It received the Bookstore Staff Award of the  Manga Award 2023. It ranked sixth for the second Crea Nighttime Manga Award in 2023.
